{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/actingtenant(_:)"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"actingTenant"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UUID"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass ","type":"text"},{"code":"nil","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to clear: the next request sends no "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-Axiam-Tenant"},{"type":"text","text":" header at all,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what “the header is sent only when set” requires and what every client"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that never calls this method already does."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Gated on what this client knows, and nothing more","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (§5.2 rule 1’s own words)."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A client holding a login result ("},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"login"},{"type":"text","text":"\/"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verifyMfa"},{"type":"text","text":"\/OPAQUE\/an"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"MFA or WebAuthn setup completion) is refused client-side, with "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"zero wire"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"calls"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", unless that principal is "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel"},{"type":"text","text":" — an ordinary"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tenant principal gets a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"403"},{"type":"text","text":" from the server for the same header change, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"offering the switch anyway would turn a type-level distinction into a runtime"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"failure the caller has to discover by trying. When"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs"},{"type":"text","text":" narrows that reach (§5.2.3), a tenant outside it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is refused the same way (rule 4)."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A client holding ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"no","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" login result — a service account from client credentials","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or the mTLS device login, or a token injected directly — has nothing to gate on.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It sends the header as asked and lets the server’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"403"},{"text":" answer: an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"organization-level service account is a supported design"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§27.13 S-9 note 2),","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and this client cannot tell the difference from here.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamError\/auth(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — client-side, no request sent — when this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"client holds a login result that is not organization-level, or whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reachableTenantIDs"},{"type":"text","text":" does not contain "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tenantID"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Act on a different tenant (or clear it), CONTRACT.md §5.2 rule 1, contract 1.51.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/actingTenant(_:)"},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"role":"symbol","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A6ClientC12actingTenantyy10Foundation4UUIDVSgKF","title":"actingTenant(_:)","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"actingTenant","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UUID","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:10Foundation4UUIDV"},{"text":"?) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"}]},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient"]]},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser":{"title":"AxiamUser","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"An authenticated AXIAM identity.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamError/auth(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK